      // Using the classic onX property (not addEventListener) here on purpose:
      // some mobile/WebView browsers don't fully implement EventTarget on the
      // speechSynthesis object, and calling addEventListener on it there throws
      // — which, unguarded, would stop this whole script partway through and
      // break pagination/rendering for the rest of the page, not just this
      // feature. The try/catch around this whole block is a second safety net
